    /// <p>The byte array data may be represented as an array (or an array-compatible data-structure such as <a href="http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qbytearray.html" translate="no">QByteArray</a>, std::basic_string, etc.) of <code translate="no">char</code>, <code translate="no">signed char</code>, <code translate="no">unsigned char</code> or <code translate="no">std::byte</code>.</p>
