    /// <p>The QDeadlineTimer class is usually used to calculate future deadlines and verify whether the deadline has expired. QDeadlineTimer can also be used for deadlines without expiration ("forever"). It forms a counterpart to <a href="http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qelapsedtimer.html" translate="no">QElapsedTimer</a>, which calculates how much time has elapsed since <a href="http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qelapsedtimer.html#start" translate="no">QElapsedTimer::start</a>() was called.</p>
