    /// <p>The typical use-case for the class is to create a QDeadlineTimer before the operation in question is started, and then use <a href="http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qdeadlinetimer.html#remainingTime" translate="no">remainingTime</a>() or <a href="http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qdeadlinetimer.html#hasExpired" translate="no">hasExpired</a>() to determine whether to continue trying the operation. QDeadlineTimer objects can be passed to functions being called to execute this operation so they know how long to still operate.</p>
