    /// <p>The QTimer class provides a high-level programming interface for timers. To use it, create a QTimer, connect its <a href="http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qtimer.html#timeout" translate="no">timeout</a>() signal to the appropriate slots, and call <a href="http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qtimer.html#start" translate="no">start</a>(). From then on, it will emit the <a href="http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qtimer.html#timeout" translate="no">timeout</a>() signal at constant intervals.</p>
