    /// </pre>
    /// <p>In this example, the timer is started by a call to <a href="http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qelapsedtimer.html#start" translate="no">start</a>() and the elapsed time is calculated by the <a href="http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qelapsedtimer.html#elapsed" translate="no">elapsed</a>() function.</p>
