    /// <p>A QThread object manages one thread of control within the program. QThreads begin executing in <a href="http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qthread.html#run" translate="no">run</a>(). By default, <a href="http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qthread.html#run" translate="no">run</a>() starts the event loop by calling <a href="http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qthread.html#exec" translate="no">exec</a>() and runs a Qt event loop inside the thread.</p>
