    /// <p>QRandomGenerator may be used to generate random values from a high-quality random number generator. Like the C++ random engines, QRandomGenerator can be seeded with user-provided values through the constructor. When seeded, the sequence of numbers generated by this class is deterministic. That is to say, given the same seed data, QRandomGenerator will generate the same sequence of numbers. But given different seeds, the results should be considerably different.</p>
