    /// <p>Use the <a href="http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qsize.html#expandedTo" translate="no">expandedTo</a>() function to retrieve a size which holds the maximum height and width of <i>this</i> size and a given size. Similarly, the <a href="http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qsize.html#boundedTo" translate="no">boundedTo</a>() function returns a size which holds the minimum height and width of <i>this</i> size and a given size.</p>
