    /// <p>QStringListModel is an editable model that can be used for simple cases where you need to display a number of strings in a view widget, such as a <a href="http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qlistview.html" translate="no">QListView</a> or a <a href="http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qcombobox.html" translate="no">QComboBox</a>.</p>
