    /// </ul>
    /// <p>Qt also provides <a href="http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qsharedpointer.html" translate="no">QSharedPointer</a>, an implementation of a reference-counted shared pointer object, which can be used to maintain a collection of references to an individual pointer.</p>
