    /// <p>The items are traversed in ascending key order.</p>
    /// <p>A QMap allows only one value per key. If you call <a href="http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qmap.html#insert" translate="no">insert</a>() with a key that already exists in the QMap, the previous value will be erased. For example:</p>
